{"name": "Salvation Denied", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-op that is funny and tense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/96c08856bc40fd56677d487e668d3883.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a game about teamwork, chaos, shouting in voice chat, and shared failures. One wrong move and the whole team pays for it. But when everything clicks, the feeling of \"we did this together\" is hard to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build by the laws of physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/f0af1c486947f23c7ae5a053b902cb3e.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every object has weight and inertia and affects the stability of the structure. Mistakes are not forgiven. An overloaded support, bad balance, or a rushed decision \u2013 and everything falls apart. Physics is not decoration here. It is the main judge. When your construction holds, the victory feels truly earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Personal construction gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/27d30b23ad9d757941fa3cfe0e358001.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gravity gun, foam gun, jetpack, and other tools. Every player has a role on the site. Move across the structure, throw parts, create temporary supports, and hold it all together at the last second. Team coordination decides everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>With great power comes great responsibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/ce58b0d0712ce1d9c83589f781c3e68a.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of massive construction machines. A gravity tank, a giant shredder bulldozer, or a levitating platform. Lift entire building sections, recycle debris, hold the structure together, and deal with threats right in the middle of the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Different locations. Completely different challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/626863ac226c1b069642530800c21e87.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every location is a new scenario with its own objective, its own rules, and its own way to fail. The tools stay the same. The teamwork stays the same. Everything else changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cataclysms as a test for your build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.poster.avif?t=1784884795\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.webm?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/extras/47b2b2f9bf2976df980b38dcf0035774.mp4?t=1784884795\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The disaster is not a cutscene. It is an active stress test for everything your team has built. Every location has its own brand of chaos \u2013 a meteor shower, or something worse. Reinforce weak spots on the fly, react fast, and keep it all together under pressure. The chaos quickly shows who can actually build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Salvation Denied is a chaotic co-op building sim for 1-4 players. Team up to build wild constructions with heavy machinery and crazy tools. Each mission brings a completely new challenge, while physics and disasters push your creation to the limit.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193590/3b9ad53399496d0b77925f3c2ce29375cd497ed1/header.jpg?t=1784884795", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Simulation", "Physics", "Building", "Funny", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Firevolt", "publishers": "Firevolt", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4193590", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 March 2026 - Request Access\n\n3 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/m9xoI_ZnIsg", "first_seen": 1774393200.0, "review_rank": 939}